Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `left` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `result` is still looking into it
  --> tests/ui/ownership/multi_source_returned_aggregate_still_blocks_owner_invalidation.jet:14:5
    |
 14 |     left.push(11)
    |     ^^^^
 Why: `result` is a live read view into `left[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `result` before changing `left`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
